{"title":"And so it begins…","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/972155138/0/marginalrevolution~And-so-it-begins.html","date":1793470888000,"content":"<blockquote><p><span>Researchers, I just uploaded a prominent QJE paper on climate change economics to </span><span><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/RefineDotInk\">@RefineDotInk </a></span><span>and I loaded my critique of the paper. I asked the AI to offer an impartial verdict. I will make this report public. A new journal could collect these into “Special Issues”.</span></p></blockquote>\r\n<p>That is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/mattkahn1966/status/2116287394714644725?s=46\" target=\"_blank\">from Matthew E. Kahn</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/10/and-so-it-begins-2.html\">And so it begins…</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/972155138/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/972155138/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/972155138/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/972155138/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/972155138/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/972155138/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https:/